<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>fell at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Tuesday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate fell to 3.06 percent.</p>
<p>					Oct 15 fix	     Oct 14 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.00 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.03 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.06 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.15 pct		3.15 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.24 pct		3.24 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.33 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
